creatures:
- name: Roc
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 15  
      **Hit Points** 248 (rollable(dice=16d20 + 80,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 20 ft., Fly 120 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Initiative) (18)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
      |Str:|number(name=str,label=Strength,value=28)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=str,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Strength Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+9,label=+9,dicelabel=Strength Saving Throw)|Int:|number(name=int,label=Intelligence,value=3)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=int,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Intelligence Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-4,label=-4,dicelabel=Intelligence Saving Throw)|
      |Dex:|number(name=dex,label=Dexterity,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=dex,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Dexterity Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Dexterity Saving Throw)|Wis:|number(name=wis,label=Wisdom,value=10)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=wis,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Wisdom Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+4,label=+4,dicelabel=Wisdom Saving Throw)|
      |Con:|number(name=con,label=Constitution,value=20)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=con,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Constitution Check)|rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Constitution Saving Throw)|Cha:|number(name=cha,label=Charisma,value=9)|mod5e(show_symbol,value=cha,dice=1d20+n,dicelabel=Charisma Check)|rollable(dice=1d20-1,label=-1,dicelabel=Charisma Saving Throw)|

      ---

      **Skills** Perception rollable(dice=1d20+8,label=+8,dicelabel=Perception Check)  
      **Senses** Passive Perception 18  
      **Languages** -  
      **Challenge** 11 (7,200 XP)  
      **Proficiency Bonus** +4  

      ## Actions

      ***Multiattack.*** The roc makes two Beak attacks. It can replace one attack with a Talons attack.

      ***Beak.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+13,label=+13,dicelabel=To Hit [Beak]), reach 10 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=3d12+9,dicelabel=Damage [Beak]) Piercing damage.

      ***Talons.*** *Melee Attack Roll* rollable(dice=1d20+13,label=+13,dicelabel=To Hit [Talons]), reach 5 ft. *Hit:* rollable(dice=4d6+9,dicelabel=Damage [Talons]) Slashing damage. If the target is a Huge or smaller creature, it has the ***Grappled*** condition (escape DC 19) from both talons, and it has the ***Restrained*** condition until the grapple ends.

      ## Bonus Actions

      ***Swoop (rollable(dice=1d6,label=Recharge 5-6,dicelabel=Recharge [Swoop])).*** If the roc has a creature ***Grappled***, the roc flies up to half its ***Fly Speed*** without provoking ***Opportunity Attacks*** and drops that creature.

    type: custom
  blurb: |
